        '3-5', $q$Nature Walks at Recess$q$, $q$(1) Every Friday, our class spends recess on the blacktop. (2) I think our school should take a short nature walk on the trail behind the field once a week instead. (3) Nature walks help students learn science outside the classroom. (4) For instance, last fall our class found three kinds of mushrooms and a nest made of mud. (5) We looked them up in our science books when we got back.

(6) ______ walking is good exercise. (7) A fifteen-minute walk gets everyone moving, even students who do not like ball games. (8) Our gym teacher, Ms. Abernathy, says that walking helps students feel calm and ready to learn. (9) My favorite color is green.

(10) Some people worry that students will get muddy on the trail. (11) Students could wear old sneakers on walk days.$q$, 'draft')
