   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence (12) as the concluding statement?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Because music teaches patience and helps with math, fourth graders should be able to join band.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Starting band in fourth grade would be really, really fun for us.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-vague"},{"text":"Every family should buy an instrument for their child right away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"new-claim-in-conclusion"},{"text":"Some fifth graders in the band already play very well.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-not-conclusion"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Because music teaches patience and helps with math, fourth graders should be able to join band.$q$, $q$The correct choice restates the opinion and links it to the two reasons the writer gave. Sentence (12) and the "really, really fun" choice only say band is fun, which is not a reason the piece supports.$q$, 'draft', '1b670fc0-644e-5400-84f1-33824ced6adf')
